resilience4j:
  circuitbreaker:
    kv-service:
      registerHealthIndicator: true
      slidingWindowSize: 100
      permittedNumberOfCallsInHalfOpenState: 10
      waitDurationInOpenState: 5s
      failureRateThreshold: 50
  retry:
    kv-service:
      maxAttempts: 3
      waitDuration: 200ms
      retryExceptions:
        - org.springframework.dao.TransientDataAccessException
```

This configuration is applied only to Region A’s services; other regions have analogous but region‑specific settings.  By isolating the resilience policy per region, we avoid a single point of failure and keep the system’s overall fault tolerance at the highest level.

