### DSA Problem Solutions

| Problem | Solution |
|---------|----------|
| **Merge two OR-sets** | Iterate over both sets, union the element sets, and union the tombstone sets. |
| **Detect convergence of LWW registers** | Compare timestamps; the newer value wins. |
| **Compute the difference between two GCounter values** | Subtract the smaller from the larger; the result is the delta to send. |

