### 3. Resilience‑4j + Axon + Kafka Pipeline

```java
@Component
public class HlcCommandDispatcher {

    @Autowired
    private CommandGateway gateway;

    @Autowired
    private KafkaTemplate<String, PutCommand> kafkaTemplate;

    @Retry(name = "commandRetry")
    @CircuitBreaker(name = "commandCB", fallbackMethod = "fallback")
    public CompletableFuture<Void> dispatch(PutCommand cmd) {
        // Send to local Axon bus
        CompletableFuture<Void> axon = gateway.send(cmd);
        // Publish to Kafka for cross‑region replication
        kafkaTemplate.send("kv-commands", cmd.getKey(), cmd);
        return axon;
    }

    private CompletableFuture<Void> fallback(PutCommand cmd, Throwable ex) {
        // Persist to out‑of‑band store or retry queue
        return CompletableFuture.completedFuture(null);
    }
}
