## C4 -- Replicate (HLC

After establishing causal ordering with Hybrid Logical Clocks (HLC) and CRDTs, the next phase is to propagate state across all replicas while preserving causality. The **Replicate (HLC)** component orchestrates this by packaging updates, sending them through a fault‑tolerant message bus, and applying them locally in a deterministic order. The following subsections detail the low‑level domain model, a REST façade, the resilience‑aware replication pipeline, a high‑level narrative, configuration, algorithmic utilities, and tooling that ties the whole pattern together.

