### Software Engineering Principles – Before / After

**Before** – Synchronous, blocking read with manual locking:

```java
synchronized (store) {
    Value v = store.get(key);
    if (v.hlc.compareTo(clientHlc) < 0) repair(v);
}
```

**After** – Reactive, non‑blocking with Resilience4j:

```java
return Mono.fromCallable(() -> store.get(key))
           .flatMap(v -> v.hlc.compareTo(clientHlc) < 0
               ? repair(v).thenReturn(v)
               : Mono.just(v))
           .timeout(Duration.ofMillis(10))
           .retryWhen(Retry.backoff(3, Duration.ofMillis(5)));
```

